#: includes/Privacy.php:51
msgid ""
"This sample privacy policy includes the basics around what personal data "
"your multivendor store may be collecting, storing and sharing, as well as "
"who may have access to that data. Depending on what settings are enabled and "
"which additional plugins are used, the specific information shared by your "
"store will vary. We recommend consulting with a lawyer when deciding what "
"information to disclose on your privacy policy."
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan privasi contoh ini mencakup dasar-dasar seputar data pribadi apa "
"yang mungkin dikumpulkan, disimpan, dan dibagikan oleh toko multivendor Anda,"
" serta siapa yang mungkin memiliki akses ke data tersebut. Bergantung pada "
"pengaturan apa yang diaktifkan dan plugin tambahan mana yang digunakan, "
"informasi spesifik yang dibagikan oleh toko Anda akan bervariasi. Kami "
"sarankan untuk berkonsultasi dengan pengacara saat memutuskan informasi apa "
"yang akan diungkapkan pada kebijakan privasi Anda."

#: includes/Privacy.php:53
msgid ""
"We collect information about you during the checkout process on our store."
msgstr ""
"Kami mengumpulkan informasi tentang Anda selama proses pembayaran di toko "
"kami."

#: includes/Privacy.php:54
msgid "What we collect and store"
msgstr "Apa yang kami kumpulkan dan simpan"

#: includes/Privacy.php:55
msgid "While you visit our site, we’ll track:"
msgstr "Saat Anda mengunjungi situs kami, kami akan melacak:"

#: includes/Privacy.php:57
msgid ""
"Stores you’ve viewed: we’ll use this to, for example, show you vendor stores "
"you’ve recently viewed"
msgstr ""
"Toko yang pernah Anda lihat: kami akan menggunakan ini untuk, misalnya, "
"menunjukkan toko vendor yang baru-baru ini Anda lihat"

#: includes/Privacy.php:58
msgid ""
"Products you’ve viewed: we’ll use this to, for example, show you products "
"you’ve recently viewed"
msgstr ""
"Produk yang telah Anda lihat: kami akan menggunakan ini untuk, misalnya, "
"menunjukkan kepada Anda produk yang baru-baru ini Anda lihat"

#: includes/Privacy.php:59
msgid ""
"Location, IP address and browser type: we’ll use this for purposes like "
"estimating taxes and shipping"
msgstr ""
"Lokasi, alamat IP, dan jenis browser: kami akan menggunakan ini untuk tujuan "
"seperti memperkirakan pajak dan pengiriman"

#: includes/Privacy.php:60
msgid ""
"Shipping address: we’ll ask you to enter this so we can, for instance, "
"estimate shipping before you place an order, and send you the order!"
msgstr ""
"Alamat pengiriman: kami akan meminta Anda untuk memasukkan alamat ini "
"sehingga kami dapat, misalnya, memperkirakan biaya pengiriman sebelum Anda "
"memesan, dan mengirimkan pesanan tersebut kepada Anda!"

#: includes/Privacy.php:62
msgid ""
"We’ll also use cookies to keep track of cart contents while you’re browsing "
"our site."
msgstr ""
"Kami juga akan menggunakan cookie untuk melacak isi keranjang belanja saat "
"Anda menjelajahi situs kami."

#: includes/Privacy.php:63
msgid ""
"Note: you may want to further detail your cookie policy, and link to that "
"section from here."
msgstr ""
"Catatan: Anda mungkin ingin merinci lebih lanjut kebijakan kuki Anda, dan "
"menautkan ke bagian tersebut dari sini."

#: includes/Privacy.php:64
msgid ""
"When you purchase from us, we’ll ask you to provide information including "
"your name, billing address, shipping address, email address, phone number, "
"credit card/payment details and optional account information like username "
"and password. We’ll use this information for purposes, such as, to:"
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda membeli dari kami, kami akan meminta Anda untuk memberikan "
"informasi termasuk nama, alamat penagihan, alamat pengiriman, alamat email, "
"nomor telepon, detail kartu kredit/pembayaran, dan informasi akun opsional "
"seperti nama pengguna dan kata sandi. Kami akan menggunakan informasi ini "
"untuk tujuan, seperti:"

#: includes/Privacy.php:66
msgid "Send you information about your account and order"
msgstr "Mengirimkan Anda informasi tentang akun dan pesanan Anda"

#: includes/Privacy.php:67
msgid "Respond to your requests, including refunds and complaints"
msgstr "Menanggapi permintaan Anda, termasuk pengembalian dana dan keluhan"

#: includes/Privacy.php:68
msgid "Process payments and prevent fraud"
msgstr "Memproses pembayaran dan mencegah penipuan"

#: includes/Privacy.php:69
msgid "Set up your account for our store"
msgstr "Siapkan akun Anda untuk toko kami"

#: includes/Privacy.php:70
msgid "Comply with any legal obligations we have, such as calculating taxes"
msgstr ""
"Mematuhi semua kewajiban hukum yang kami miliki, seperti menghitung pajak"

#: includes/Privacy.php:71
msgid "Improve our store offerings"
msgstr "Tingkatkan penawaran toko kami"

#: includes/Privacy.php:72
msgid "Send you marketing messages, if you choose to receive them"
msgstr ""
"Mengirimkan pesan pemasaran kepada Anda, jika Anda memilih untuk menerimanya"

#: includes/Privacy.php:74
msgid ""
"If you create an account, we will store your name, address, email and phone "
"number, which will be used to populate the checkout for future orders."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda membuat akun, kami akan menyimpan nama, alamat, email, dan nomor "
"telepon Anda, yang akan digunakan untuk mengisi formulir pembayaran untuk "
"pesanan selanjutnya."

#: includes/Privacy.php:75
msgid ""
"We generally store information about you for as long as we need the "
"information for the purposes for which we collect and use it, and we are not "
"legally required to continue to keep it. For example, we will store order "
"information for XXX years for tax and accounting purposes. This includes "
"your name, email address and billing and shipping addresses."
msgstr ""
"Kami biasanya menyimpan informasi tentang Anda selama kami membutuhkan "
"informasi tersebut untuk tujuan pengumpulan dan penggunaan informasi "
"tersebut, dan kami tidak diwajibkan secara hukum untuk terus menyimpannya. "
"Misalnya, kami akan menyimpan informasi pesanan selama XXX tahun untuk "
"tujuan pajak dan akuntansi. Ini termasuk nama, alamat email, dan alamat "
"penagihan dan pengiriman Anda."

#: includes/Privacy.php:76
msgid "We will also store comments or reviews, if you choose to leave them."
msgstr ""
"Kami juga akan menyimpan komentar atau ulasan, jika Anda memilih untuk "
"meninggalkannya."

#: includes/Privacy.php:77
msgid "Who on our team has access"
msgstr "Siapa di tim kami yang memiliki akses"

#: includes/Privacy.php:78
msgid ""
"Members of our team have access to the information you provide us. For "
"example, both Administrators and Shop Managers can access:"
msgstr ""
"Anggota tim kami memiliki akses ke informasi yang Anda berikan kepada kami. "
"Misalnya, Administrator dan Manajer Toko dapat mengakses:"

#: includes/Privacy.php:80
msgid ""
"Order information like what was purchased, when it was purchased and where "
